Scope of this dedication

It covers what this repository authors: the tooling in `tools/`, the documentation in `docs/` and
the generated site, the signal maps and labels in `reference/`, the captures, profiles and evidence
files, and the derived, deobfuscated form of the agent in `agent/` and `collector/`.

It does not and cannot cover the original Fingerprint Pro browser agent, which is not redistributed
here and remains the property of its authors. "Fingerprint" and the fingerprint mark are trademarks
of Fingerprint (fingerprint.com). This project is unofficial and not affiliated with, endorsed by or
supported by them. The logo used by this project is a derivative of their mark, used to identify
what is being documented, not to imply any connection.

Contact, including takedown and legal enquiries: proofofbot@pm.me
